1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,600
Static. So you walk faster. Too fast.
Under your coat, you start to sweat.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,233
Rule three. Stay dry before you stay
warm. Sweat turns to ice the second
you stop.

3
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:19,167
Wet clothes pull heat from your body
about twenty-five times faster than
dry air. You stop. You take off one
layer. You lose four minutes.

4
00:00:19,867 --> 00:00:21,500
Then the cold finds your lungs.

5
00:00:22,267 --> 00:00:28,600
Scarf over the mouth. Breathe through
the wool. Slow. Puff number one. Warm
from my skin. It works.
